# Temporary agent scratch files (see AGENTS.md §6)
#
# ⚠️ TRAP: `_*` also matches names that start with TWO underscores (`__tests__`, `__root.tsx`). Without the
# two exception lines below, **16 test files and the `__root.tsx` route vanish from git** —
# cloning the repo would build red. It really happened; do not drop the exceptions when editing this block.
_*
!**/__tests__/
!**/__root.tsx
*.probe.test.ts
preview.html
_shot-*.png
*.dump
*.bak

